{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "default",
  "displayName": {
    "zh-CN": "默认小伙伴",
    "en-US": "Default Buddy",
    "ja-JP": "デフォルトの相棒"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh-CN": "程序化绘制的扁平风格内置形象，6 个状态各一组序列帧。",
    "en-US": "Procedurally drawn flat-style built-in character, one frame sequence per state.",
    "ja-JP": "プログラムで描画したフラット調の内蔵キャラクター。状態ごとに連番フレーム。"
  },
  "canvas": 256,
  "anchor": "bottom-center",
  "animations": {
    "idle": {
      "frameCount": 6,
      "frameIntervalMs": 220,
      "loop": true
    },
    "talking": {
      "frameCount": 6,
      "frameIntervalMs": 150,
      "loop": true
    },
    "working": {
      "frameCount": 6,
      "frameIntervalMs": 140,
      "loop": true
    },
    "success": {
      "frameCount": 8,
      "frameIntervalMs": 130,
      "loop": true
    },
    "failure": {
      "frameCount": 6,
      "frameIntervalMs": 200,
      "loop": true
    },
    "listening": {
      "frameCount": 6,
      "frameIntervalMs": 160,
      "loop": true
    }
  },
  "_comment": "本目录下的 PNG 由 tools/gen_pet_skin.py 生成，skin.json 只声明帧间隔，实际帧数以目录内文件数为准（见 PetRenderer::loadSkinManifest）。"
}